  "description": "Design Spotify or Amazon Music as asked in real Amazon, Apple and Flipkart SDE-2 rounds: catalogue model, audio in S3 behind a CDN, fast play start, Elasticsearch fuzzy search under 200 ms, playlists, listening history, consistency choices and the Alexa voice-to-play flow.",
