    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">45 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">Apple</span><span class=\"chip company\">Flipkart</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Music Streaming (Spotify / Amazon Music)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Design a music app for 500M users where any of 70M songs starts playing in a blink, search finds \"shap of yu\" in under 200 ms, playlists can be reshuffled and shared, and every play feeds recommendations - the exact shape Amazon, Apple and Flipkart asked in 2024-2026 SDE-2 rounds.</p>\n      "
